{%- comment -%}
  Loading — not in the approved mockup (a local-state-only design has
  nothing to wait on); added because a real boot exchanges a handoff and
  fetches the customer's pets before anything else can render. Styled with
  the design's own accent colour rather than a generic spinner.
{%- endcomment -%}
<section class="vphp__screen" data-vphp-screen="loading" aria-live="polite">
  <div class="vphp__col vphp__col--narrow vphp__center">
    <span class="vphp__spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <p class="vphp__loading-text" data-vphp-field="loading.message">Loading your pet's profile&hellip;</p>
  </div>
</section>
